<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #fff; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; }
    .section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .section h2 { color: #10b981; border-bottom: 2px solid #10b981; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .metric { background: #f0fdf4; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; }
    .metric-name { font-weight: bold; color: #065f46; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .metric-value { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981; }
    .metric-unit { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; }
    .score { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
    .score-circle { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; border: 8px solid #10b981; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981; }
    .opportunities { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .opportunities li { padding: 15px; background: #fef3c7; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; }
    .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 style="margin: 0;">⚡ PageSpeed 월간 리포트</h1>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9;"><%= @date.strftime('%Y년 %m월') %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <!-- Performance Score -->
      <div class="section">
        <h2>종합 성능 점수</h2>
        <div class="score">
          <div class="score-circle">
            <%= @report[:performance_score] %>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-top: 15px; color: #6b7280;">100점 만점</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Web Vitals -->
      <div class="section">
        <h2>📊 Core Web Vitals</h2>

        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-name">First Contentful Paint (FCP)</div>
          <div class="metric-value"><%= @report[:fcp_ms] %> <span class="metric-unit">ms</span></div>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">첫 번째 콘텐츠가 화면에 표시되는 시간</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-name">Largest Contentful Paint (LCP)</div>
          <div class="metric-value"><%= @report[:lcp_ms] %> <span class="metric-unit">ms</span></div>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">가장 큰 콘텐츠가 표시되는 시간 (2,500ms 이하 권장)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-name">Total Blocking Time (TBT)</div>
          <div class="metric-value"><%= @report[:tbt_ms] %> <span class="metric-unit">ms</span></div>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">페이지가 반응하지 않는 총 시간</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-name">Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)</div>
          <div class="metric-value"><%= @report[:cls] %></div>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">레이아웃 변경 누적 점수 (0.1 이하 권장)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 개선 제안 -->
      <div class="section">
        <h2>💡 개선 제안</h2>
        <ul class="opportunities">
          <% (@report[:opportunities] || []).each do |opp| %>
            <li><%= opp %></li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>실무.kr SEO 자동 모니터링 시스템</p>
        <p><a href="https://silmu.kr" style="color: #10b981; text-decoration: none;">실무.kr 방문하기</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
